            <h1>Advanced AGV Transfer Carts/Trolleys for Automated and Efficient Material Transport</h1>
            <p>AGV transfer cart is a trackless transfer cart guided by electromagnetic or optical means. Equipped with electromagnetic or optical guidance devices, it can automatically navigate along predetermined routes and has the ability to avoid obstacles. It boasts high safety protection and does not require human operation, achieving full automation in industrial applications.</p>
            <p>AGVs can efficiently, accurately, and flexibly perform material handling tasks. They are widely used in manufacturing, pharmaceuticals, logistics, and various heavy industries.</p>
            <div class="wp-block-buttons FormButton is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
              <div class="wp-block-button">
                <a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="#from-single" style="border-radius:0px">
                  Request for Quotation
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p></p>
            <ProductGallery>
              <figure class="swiper-slide">
                <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/AGV-Transfer-Cart.png" width="870" height="580" alt="AGV Transfer Cart" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="swiper-slide">
                <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/agv-transfer-cart-applications-in-warehousing.jpg" width="870" height="580" alt="agv transfer cart applications in warehousing" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="swiper-slide">
                <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/agv-transfer-cart-applications-in-manufacturing.jpg" width="870" height="580" alt="agv transfer cart applications in manufacturing" />
              </figure>
              <figure class="swiper-slide">
                <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/agv-transfer-cart-applications-in-port.png" width="870" height="580" alt="agv transfer cart applications in port" />
              </figure>
