            <p></p>
            <h2>Feature</h2>
            <p><strong>Path Planning: </strong>Optimize the travel path of the mobile transfer trolley based on real-time conditions and guide the transfer cart to follow the planned route.</p>
            <p><strong>Transfer Cart Management: </strong>Centrally manage and queue the on-site transfer trolley to facilitate dispatch system usage. Integrate with the battery BMS charging requirements to achieve automatic charging.</p>
            <p><strong>Traffic Control: </strong>Manage traffic in specific areas according to the working site conditions, allowing passage based on priority to prevent traffic deadlock.</p>
            <p><strong>Task Scheduling: </strong>Select the optimal transfer cart from the idle transfer cart based on allocation strategies and guide the transfer cart to complete the transport task along a specific route.</p>
            <p><strong>Real-time Monitoring: </strong>Use a graphical interface to display the entire site’s operation in real-time, with the capability for manual intervention as needed.</p>
            <p><strong>Obstacle Avoidance Strategy: </strong>Define matching obstacle avoidance strategies based on different control trajectories of the operating transfer trolley to ensure the safety of the transfer trolley during operation.</p>
