            <h2>Application</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Warehousing: </strong>Achieve automatic handling of inbound and outbound goods.</li>
              <li><strong>Manufacturing: </strong>A flexible logistics handling system composed of multiple AGV transfer trolleys can adjust the handling routes in real-time according to the production process, enabling more than a dozen products on a single production line. This greatly improves production flexibility and competitiveness.</li>
              <li><strong>Post offices, libraries, ports, and airports: </strong>In environments such as post offices, libraries, docks, and airports, where there are large fluctuations in workload, strong dynamics, frequent adjustments to operations, and a single handling process, the parallel operation, automation, intelligence, and flexibility of AGV transfer trolleys can meet the handling requirements well.</li>
              <li><strong>Tobacco, pharmaceuticals, food, chemicals: </strong>AGV transfer carts are widely used in industries such as tobacco, pharmaceuticals, food, and chemicals that have special requirements for cleanliness, safety, and emission-free pollution. Many cigarette companies use laser-guided AGV transfer carts to handle tray goods.</li>
              <li><strong>Hazardous places and special industries: </strong>In film warehouses, AGV transfer trolleys can accurately and reliably transport materials and semi-finished products in dark environments.</li>
            </ul>
